---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const articleSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  "headline": "Ready Possession vs Under Construction Flats in Pune: Tax, Risk & ROI Analysis 2026",
  "description": "Comparative guide evaluating Ready Possession versus Under-Construction apartments in Pune. Analyze GST savings, construction-linked payment plans (CLP), MahaRERA protections, and capital gains tax rules.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Pune Real Estate Research Desk"
  },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Mahindra Rivenza"
  },
  "datePublished": "2026-10-09",
  "dateModified": "2026-10-10"
};
---

<Layout
  title="Ready vs Under Construction Flats Pune | ROI, Tax & Risk Guide"
  description="Detailed comparison between ready-to-move and under-construction flats in Pune. Explore GST differences, capital appreciation, CLP payment plans & MahaRERA safety."
  canonical="https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/articles/ready-possession-vs-under-construction-pune/"
  customSchema={articleSchema}
>
  <article class="pt-32 pb-24 bg-charcoal-950 text-stone-300">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-10">
      
      <div class="space-y-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-8">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs text-gold-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">
          <a href="/articles/" class="hover:underline">← All Research</a>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>Buyer Decision Framework</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>October 2026</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-stone-100 leading-tight">
          Ready Possession vs Under-Construction Flats in Pune: The 2026 Investment Framework
        </h1>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-stone-400 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Should you buy an immediate ready-to-move apartment or invest in an under-construction project from an institutional developer like Mahindra Lifespaces? Here is the complete financial, legal, and tax comparison.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content Sections -->
      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-stone-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-white">1. Financial Comparison Matrix</h2>
        
        <div class="overflow-x-auto my-6">
          <table class="w-full text-left text-xs border border-white/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
            <thead class="bg-charcoal-900 text-gold-400 font-mono uppercase">
              <tr>
                <th class="p-3 border-b border-white/10">Parameter</th>
                <th class="p-3 border-b border-white/10">Ready Possession (With OC)</th>
                <th class="p-3 border-b border-white/10">Under-Construction (Grade-A Developer)</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-white/5">
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-white">Acquisition Price</td>
                <td class="p-3">20% to 35% Higher Premium</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-emerald-400">Launch Price Entry (Maximum Upside)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-white">Payment Flexibility</td>
                <td class="p-3">100% Upfront Downpayment / Immediate Full EMI</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-emerald-400">Construction-Linked Plan (CLP) in Milestones</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-white">GST Liability</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-emerald-400">0% (Nil GST with Occupancy Certificate)</td>
                <td class="p-3">5% (Effective GST for Non-Affordable Housing)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-white">MahaRERA Security</td>
                <td class="p-3">Project already closed</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-emerald-400">70% Escrow Account Mandate &amp; Fixed Possession Date</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-white">Capital Appreciation</td>
                <td class="p-3">Moderate (3% – 5% annually)</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-emerald-400">High (12% – 18% during build phase)</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-white">2. Why Grade-A Developers Minimize Execution Risk</h2>
        <p>
          Historical execution delays in Pune were primarily concentrated among unorganized, debt-laden local builders. By partnering with institutional giants like <strong>Mahindra Lifespaces</strong> (a listed entity backed by the 75+ year Mahindra Group), buyers benefit from:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>Zero debt dependency on customer cashflow for initial structural work.</li>
          <li>100% adherence to MahaRERA project milestones with transparent quarterly filings.</li>
          <li>Substantial price appreciation from launch phase to handover.</li>
        </ul>

      </div>

      <!-- Lead Advisory Card -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-charcoal-900 via-charcoal-800 to-charcoal-900 border border-gold-500/30 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 shadow-2xl">
        <div class="space-y-1 text-center sm:text-left">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white">Compare Payment Plans &amp; Possession Milestones</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-300">Speak with our sales advisory team regarding construction milestones for Mahindra Rivenza.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <a href="tel:+917744009295" class="px-5 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gold-500 hover:bg-gold-400 text-charcoal-950 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors">
            Call: +91 7744009295
          </a>
          <a href="/pricing/" class="px-5 py-3 rounded-lg bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/15 border border-white/20 text-white text-xs font-semibold transition-colors">
            Check Payment Plans
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
